  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u9d1e70be\" id=\"u9d1e70be\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d5c1c30\" id=\"u6d5c1c30\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">在鲁班猫板卡上开发纯软件类型的Python应用程序与PC上并无区别， 使用Python控制板卡上的GPIO、PWM、ADC、I2C及SPI等外围接口时，主要使用到了如下的Python包：</span></p><ul list=\"ue1723808\"><li fid=\"ubb90aae6\" data-lake-id=\"u61ad7bec\" id=\"u61ad7bec\"><a href=\"https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/libs/libgpiod/libgpiod.git/about/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u68d85373\" id=\"u68d85373\"><span data-lake-id=\"u25d6cce7\" id=\"u25d6cce7\">python3-libgpiod</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u58e51d2d\" id=\"u58e51d2d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">：标准GPIO libgpiod库的python版本，只支持控制IO输入输出。</span></li><li fid=\"ubb90aae6\" data-lake-id=\"u0fe16589\" id=\"u0fe16589\"><a href=\"https://python-periphery.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6b3dd0b9\" id=\"u6b3dd0b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u572351af\" id=\"u572351af\">python-periphery</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u3c214825\" id=\"u3c214825\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">：支持GPIO、PWM、I2C、SPI、UART等多种接口的基础控制。</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"LHFWw\" id=\"LHFWw\"><span data-lake-id=\"uace2b5d7\" id=\"uace2b5d7\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">libgpiod基本概念</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u5e094049\" id=\"u5e094049\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59f97eb1\" id=\"u59f97eb1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">GPIO主要用来对外输出高低电平，控制GPIO时，基本都会涉及到 libgpiod 的控制， 我们主要需要知道板卡引脚的命名方式即可。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4fbd606e\" id=\"u4fbd606e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u711f32c4\" id=\"u711f32c4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">CPU的GPIO引脚使用 </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc9aecb8c\" id=\"uc9aecb8c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">(chip, line)</span><span data-lake-id=\"u517f3b62\" id=\"u517f3b62\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 的方式命名，使用以下命令可以查看：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E4%B8%8A%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%5Cnsudo%20gpioinfo%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%8B%A5%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%89%BE%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B0%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%5Cnsudo%20apt%20-y%20install%20gpiod%20libgpiod-dev%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%BAgpioinfo%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%5Cngpiochip0%20-%2032%20lines%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20line%20%20%200%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20line%20%20%201%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20line%20%20%202%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20line%20%20%203%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20line%20%20%204%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20line%20%20%205%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%5C%22headset_gpio%5C%22%20input%20active-high%20%5Bused%5D%5Cn%23%20...%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20line%20%2031%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cngpiochip1%20-%2032%20lines%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%200%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%201%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%23%20...%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%2031%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zB80D%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2505999f\" id=\"u2505999f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf39613d7\" id=\"uf39613d7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">而板卡引出的排针接口与GPIO (chip, line)的对应方式可查看板卡具体的说明。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"RAjal\" id=\"RAjal\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufba9d018\" id=\"ufba9d018\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">方式一：使用python3-libgpiod</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"sPwGq\" id=\"sPwGq\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6718244d\" id=\"u6718244d\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">安装 python3-libgpiod</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u72300958\" id=\"u72300958\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6c9a9fb\" id=\"ud6c9a9fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">利用 </span><a href=\"https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/libs/libgpiod/libgpiod.git/about/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u95d1baaf\" id=\"u95d1baaf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9169f50f\" id=\"u9169f50f\">python3-libgpiod</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ud01a9433\" id=\"ud01a9433\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 软件包，可以轻松使用Python控制GPIO引脚。 目前 </span><a href=\"https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/libs/libgpiod/libgpiod.git/about/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf9d82a34\" id=\"uf9d82a34\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71dff9a2\" id=\"u71dff9a2\">python3-libgpiod</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u0d263ee8\" id=\"u0d263ee8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 没有官方文档说明，可使用import该软件包后使用help查看帮助， 它的安装及查看帮助方式如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%5Cnsudo%20apt%20-y%20install%20python3-libgpiod%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5python%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%8F%8A%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%5Cnpython3%5Cnimport%20gpiod%5Cnhelp(gpiod)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%BA%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%5CnNAME%5Cn%20%20%20%20gpiod%20-%20Python%20bindings%20for%20libgpiod.%5Cn%5CnDESCRIPTION%5Cn%20%20%20%20This%20module%20wraps%20the%20native%20C%20API%20of%20libgpiod%20in%20a%20set%20of%20python%20classes.%5Cn%23%20...%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OuBcd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"SpbpF\" id=\"SpbpF\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b89757b\" id=\"u4b89757b\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">libgpiod输出</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua5f9a61c\" id=\"ua5f9a61c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ee89778\" id=\"u7ee89778\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">使用这个 </span><a href=\"https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/libs/libgpiod/libgpiod.git/about/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud7696af9\" id=\"ud7696af9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c1b009e\" id=\"u3c1b009e\">python3-libgpiod</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5f0613ab\" id=\"u5f0613ab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 包控制GPIO点灯（输出）的示例代码如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20time%5Cnimport%20gpiod%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E7%9A%84LED%E7%81%AF%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84Chip%E5%92%8CLine%2C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89LED%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%96%E6%8E%A5%5CnLINE_OFFSET%20%3D%204%5Cn%5Cnchip0%20%3D%20gpiod.Chip(%5C%221%5C%22%2C%20gpiod.Chip.OPEN_BY_NUMBER)%5Cn%5Cngpio0_b0%20%3D%20chip0.get_line(LINE_OFFSET)%5Cngpio0_b0.request(consumer%3D%5C%22gpio%5C%22%2C%20type%3Dgpiod.LINE_REQ_DIR_OUT%2C%20default_vals%3D%5B0%5D)%5Cn%5Cnprint(gpio0_b0.consumer())%5Cn%5Cntry%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20gpio0_b0.set_value(1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(0.5)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20gpio0_b0.set_value(0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(0.5)%5Cnfinally%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20gpio0_b0.set_value(1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20gpio0_b0.release()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lqeRj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uedc40e63\" id=\"uedc40e63\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf0ebcec2\" id=\"uf0ebcec2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">代码说明：</span></p><ul list=\"u1b6edc40\"><li fid=\"u0531e08a\" data-lake-id=\"u5c86fe47\" id=\"u5c86fe47\"><span data-lake-id=\"u884bb2c7\" id=\"u884bb2c7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第7行，创建了一个chip ID为0的gpiod.Chip对象chip0</span></li><li fid=\"u0531e08a\" data-lake-id=\"u129cc4b7\" id=\"u129cc4b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72ee559a\" id=\"u72ee559a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第9行，设置使用chip0对象的line4作为引脚</span></li><li fid=\"u0531e08a\" data-lake-id=\"u549437b6\" id=\"u549437b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a0ee059\" id=\"u6a0ee059\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第10行，申请gpio，设置为输出，默认输出低电平</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ucfad5d9e\" id=\"ucfad5d9e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0027d1d9\" id=\"u0027d1d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">后面的代码直接使用gpio0_b0对象控制选定的GPIO输出高低电平，从而达到控制LED灯的亮灭。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufaa80f1b\" id=\"ufaa80f1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1589990c\" id=\"u1589990c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">使用如下命令执行:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20python3%20Test.py%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cIbG6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u039af33d\" id=\"u039af33d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b6093c9\" id=\"u8b6093c9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">权限被拒绝可以修改权限</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20chmod%20777%20%2Fdev%2Fgpiochip1%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K7fbU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"CrTeY\" id=\"CrTeY\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud53db9f7\" id=\"ud53db9f7\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">libgpiod输入输出</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u2b8881a2\" id=\"u2b8881a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8096fd4\" id=\"ud8096fd4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">类似地，使用这个</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf2d21e23\" id=\"uf2d21e23\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><a href=\"https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/libs/libgpiod/libgpiod.git/about/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u48ed97ef\" id=\"u48ed97ef\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueeb03a40\" id=\"ueeb03a40\">python3-libgpiod</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1a29aed3\" id=\"u1a29aed3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u61c8e1cc\" id=\"u61c8e1cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">包检测GPIO输入（按键）的示例代码如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20gpiod%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E7%9A%84LED%E7%81%AF%E5%92%8C%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84Chip%E5%92%8CLine%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E4%BB%A5LubanCat%202%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8GPIO0_B0%E6%8E%A5LED%EF%BC%8CGPIO0_C2%E6%8E%A5%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE%5CnLED_LINE_OFFSET%20%3D%204%5CnBUTTON_LINE_OFFSET%20%3D%201%5Cn%5Cnchip0_led%20%3D%20gpiod.Chip(%5C%221%5C%22%2C%20gpiod.Chip.OPEN_BY_NUMBER)%5Cnchip0_button%20%3D%20gpiod.Chip(%5C%221%5C%22%2C%20gpiod.Chip.OPEN_BY_NUMBER)%5Cn%5Cnled%20%3D%20chip0_led.get_line(LED_LINE_OFFSET)%5Cnled.request(consumer%3D%5C%22LED%5C%22%2C%20type%3Dgpiod.LINE_REQ_DIR_OUT%2C%20default_vals%3D%5B0%5D)%5Cn%5Cnbutton%20%3D%20chip0_button.get_line(BUTTON_LINE_OFFSET)%5Cnbutton.request(consumer%3D%5C%22BUTTON%5C%22%2C%20type%3Dgpiod.LINE_REQ_DIR_IN)%5Cn%5Cnprint(led.consumer())%5Cnprint(button.consumer())%5Cn%5Cntry%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20led.set_value(button.get_value())%5Cnfinally%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20led.set_value(1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20led.release()%5Cn%20%20%20%20button.release()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hm8pR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u53e22356\" id=\"u53e22356\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75896732\" id=\"u75896732\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">代码说明：</span></p><ul list=\"udbeeb2f3\"><li fid=\"u5fa964c6\" data-lake-id=\"u3617b1d5\" id=\"u3617b1d5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65990d94\" id=\"u65990d94\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第13行，设置LED的GPIO控制方向为输出</span></li><li fid=\"u5fa964c6\" data-lake-id=\"ub6a11612\" id=\"ub6a11612\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf22a5a97\" id=\"uf22a5a97\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第16行，设置按键的GPIO控制方向为输入</span></li><li fid=\"u5fa964c6\" data-lake-id=\"u7cefd352\" id=\"u7cefd352\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6341186a\" id=\"u6341186a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第23行，读取按键引脚的输入值来控制LED</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"uxR1n\" id=\"uxR1n\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubefdf501\" id=\"ubefdf501\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">方式二:使用python-periphery</span></h1><h3 data-lake-id=\"y7z6f\" id=\"y7z6f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u226f069a\" id=\"u226f069a\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">安装python-periphery</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u4567ada6\" id=\"u4567ada6\"><a href=\"https://python-periphery.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u95b5c7c3\" id=\"u95b5c7c3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35b1627e\" id=\"u35b1627e\">python-periphery</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u08659d49\" id=\"u08659d49\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uf3840838\" id=\"uf3840838\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">与</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1b7b7f45\" id=\"u1b7b7f45\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><a href=\"https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/libs/libgpiod/libgpiod.git/about/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ufe23582d\" id=\"ufe23582d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufcda40e6\" id=\"ufcda40e6\">python3-libgpiod</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1102cea0\" id=\"u1102cea0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u42becdf9\" id=\"u42becdf9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">的功能类似，但periphery除了支持GPIO输入输出控制外， 还支持I2C、SPI等总线协议。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc6ed2b1d\" id=\"uc6ed2b1d\"><a href=\"https://python-periphery.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uea610d64\" id=\"uea610d64\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1dcc160e\" id=\"u1dcc160e\">python-periphery</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u2243b12b\" id=\"u2243b12b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 的安装方式如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%5Cnsudo%20pip3%20install%20python-periphery%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I1aAs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"WidDq\" id=\"WidDq\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f3b62ba\" id=\"u7f3b62ba\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">periphery输入输出</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20periphery%20import%20GPIO%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E7%9A%84LED%E7%81%AF%E5%92%8C%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84Chip%E5%92%8CLine%5Cn%23%20%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E4%BB%A5LubanCat%202%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8GPIO0_B0%E6%8E%A5LED%EF%BC%8CGPIO0_C2%E6%8E%A5%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE%5CnLED_CHIP%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fdev%2Fgpiochip1%5C%22%5CnLED_LINE_OFFSET%20%3D%204%5Cn%5CnBUTTON_CHIP%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fdev%2Fgpiochip1%5C%22%5CnBUTTON_LINE_OFFSET%20%3D%201%5Cn%5Cnled%20%3D%20GPIO(LED_CHIP%2C%20LED_LINE_OFFSET%2C%20%5C%22out%5C%22)%5Cnbutton%20%3D%20GPIO(BUTTON_CHIP%2C%20BUTTON_LINE_OFFSET%2C%20%5C%22in%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cntry%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20led.write(button.read())%5Cnfinally%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20led.write(True)%5Cn%20%20%20%20led.close()%5Cn%20%20%20%20button.close()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22up6Q8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3a0895c8\" id=\"u3a0895c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3d55c7a\" id=\"ua3d55c7a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">代码说明：</span></p><ul list=\"u87bdfe0c\"><li fid=\"ud8b2b1f0\" data-lake-id=\"ufc3443dd\" id=\"ufc3443dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd163bbc\" id=\"ubd163bbc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第5~9行，定义了LED、按键的chip和line编号</span></li><li fid=\"ud8b2b1f0\" data-lake-id=\"ucfaeb150\" id=\"ucfaeb150\"><span data-lake-id=\"uac75a4b0\" id=\"uac75a4b0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第11~12行，分别创建了led和button的GPIO输出、输入对象</span></li><li fid=\"ud8b2b1f0\" data-lake-id=\"u063c90d1\" id=\"u063c90d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee81224a\" id=\"uee81224a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第16行，读取按键引脚的输入值来控制LED</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"ZN3Xa\" id=\"ZN3Xa\"><br></h1>",
